- Algolia credentials are server-side only; client calls authenticated proxy endpoint
- Rate limiting (30 req/min) per user+IP
- Input validation with Zod on both client and server
- URL protocol validation before navigation
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` or other XSS sinks
- Structured logging with sanitized values
- Search-only Algolia API key (not admin key)
- Authentication required for all search requests
